{"content":[{"c":["GEDEROTHAIM"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["Village in the Judean Shephelah (",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.36","r":"Josh.15.36","rawR":"Josh.15.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.36","value":"Josh.15.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jos 15:36"},") of unknown location. The Hebrew list contains 14 cities without Gederothaim (vv ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.33-36","r":"Josh.15.33-36","rawR":"Josh.15.33-36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.33-36","value":"Josh.15.33-36"}],"t":"ref","v":"33-36"},"), while the Greek version reads, “Gederah and her sheepfolds” (v ",{"href":"?bref=Josh.15.36","r":"Josh.15.36","rawR":"Josh.15.36","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Josh.15.36","value":"Josh.15.36"}],"t":"ref","v":"36"},"). Gederothaim probably reflects a later scribal error where the copyist accidentally made the term “sheepfold” into a 15th city."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"}],"format":"bsb-study-dictionary-v2","id":"Gederothaim","provenance":{"archiveSha256":"10758ea00dbea7540f9337e43e59c8e4000295c1261e3426bab6f31c31dcff5b","release":"1.6","sourceCitationReferences":[{"anchorText":"Jos 15:36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.36","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.36","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.36"},{"anchorText":"33-36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.33-36","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.33-36","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.33-36"},{"anchorText":"36","canonicalization":"deferred_to_dictionary_mapping_workstream","hrefExact":"?bref=Josh.15.36","rawQueryValue":"Josh.15.36","sourceRefExact":"Josh.15.36"}],"sourceItemFragmentSha256":"728cc44c1d772834623bd26e8c6a1a30a1e7a5be091a8033aef879694b977191","sourceItemName":"Gederothaim","sourceItemOrder":76,"sourceMember":"Articles/G.xml","supplementPointersNotIncludedAsContent":[]},"sourceAttributes":{"name":"Gederothaim","product":"TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","typename":"Article"},"sourceTitleExact":"Gederothaim","title":"Gederothaim","version":"v2-a101d